{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "memory_018ele_002_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_018ele_002_1000_p", "source_sha256": "086d2f9aecb3004bb29cf99c0f469bd89938a258c97ab82597287e23452f3531", "ja": "（今日はエレナの宣材写真を撮りに来たんだけど、\nその本人が時間になっても来ない……どうしたんだ？）", "zh": "（今天要来拍艾琳娜的宣传照，\n时间都到了，她本人却还没来……怎么了吗？）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "memory_018ele_002_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_018ele_002_1001_018ele", "source_sha256": "19cfadeb009f165dfd342cafc232203c467ab3783a1f4492ffcadc598f225140", "ja": "おはよー、{$P$}！\n難しい顔して、どうしちゃったのかナ？", "zh": "早安──{$P$}！\n看你一脸伤脑筋，发生什么事了吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "memory_018ele_002_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_018ele_002_1002_p", "source_sha256": "b90d419ec1b880c145948c6b4de548d8bc486891bb0794d1e19e7b944abb7d63", "ja": "あっ……エレナ！", "zh": "啊……艾琳娜！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "memory_018ele_002_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_018ele_002_1003_018ele", "source_sha256": "1da9386550639deaf28062550ffa0096fbaa0b976de21c27488ecd7ef19d8aa3", "ja": "眉間にシワが寄っちゃってるヨ～？　楽しい気持ちが\nどこかに行っちゃう前に、ホラ、笑顔笑顔っ！", "zh": "你的眉头皱得很紧喔～？\n趁开心的心情消失之前，来，笑一个笑一个！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "memory_018ele_002_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_018ele_002_1004_p", "source_sha256": "017d3a760dfc8a042cb12473037f110a60366d12670d01e6703b1ed6e1ab19be", "ja": "そういうことじゃなくて……エレナが\n連絡もなく遅刻するから、心配してたんだ。", "zh": "不是那样的……\n因为艾琳娜没跟我说一声就迟到，我才会担心。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "memory_018ele_002_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_018ele_002_1005_018ele", "source_sha256": "98964d8a0e45eb621f75a3c6edb0b949a1479576fd13d03b88a23b09491de23b", "ja": "アレ、そうだったノ？\n心配かけてごめんネ、{$P$}。", "zh": "咦，是这样吗？\n抱歉让你担心了，{$P$}。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "memory_018ele_002_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_018ele_002_1006_p", "source_sha256": "c21992f7451152177a96d3b0fce077f02dcd551be4d7a2c1a7e23c1476660d52", "ja": "いや、無事だったからよかったけど。\nそれより、どうして遅れたんだ？", "zh": "算了，既然你没事就好。\n比起这个，你为什么迟到？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "memory_018ele_002_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_018ele_002_1007_018ele", "source_sha256": "3c8a79f9cf79a901ade6412cf788a2c621c480bf2894cb8564d9e6efb296707a", "ja": "今日、天気がいいでショ？\nだから、この辺りをグル～って散歩してきたノ。", "zh": "你看今天天气很好吧？\n所以我就去附近绕～了一圈散散步。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "memory_018ele_002_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_018ele_002_1008_018ele", "source_sha256": "e13df8e49fb5192c92abf68c17ef5bd76cb96736aef2159c12376318718f3a72", "ja": "{$P$}、知ってる？　緑がいっぱいの\n公園があるんだヨ！　すっごく気持ちよかった～♪", "zh": "{$P$}，你知道吗？\n这附近有个绿油油的公园喔！很舒服呢～♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "memory_018ele_002_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_018ele_002_1009_p", "source_sha256": "5d6b2b46a4abc2d678384c31ef7b11915d4e058b2593a889ed1654dd02d09f5f", "ja": "散歩って……。\nエレナ、今日撮影があるのはわかってたよな？", "zh": "散散步……\n艾琳娜，你知道今天要拍照吧？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "memory_018ele_002_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_018ele_002_1010_018ele", "source_sha256": "a4ec8ff865457cfcba3d60cc033d291cd3004bea7f16200333f91271f37d6dfc", "ja": "モチロン！　でも、とってもステキな公園だったノ。\nあとで{$P$}とも行きたいナ♪", "zh": "当然知道！但那个公园真的很棒。\n希望待会能和{$P$}一起去走走♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "memory_018ele_002_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_018ele_002_1011_p", "source_sha256": "f99aaa7cccdda15026b97a7352373f9b5733c960b6b08e1d3eb110f99ce4cec4", "ja": "（この笑顔、たぶん本人に悪気はないんだろうな。\nとはいえ……）", "zh": "（看这笑容，她本身大概是没有恶意吧。\n话虽如此……）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "memory_018ele_002_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_018ele_002_1012", "source_sha256": "ec4d4cb4c7b71dda7d7bf1826276692cb65ec7fdd5727c0bafc57593db5f880a", "ja": "きちんと話す", "zh": "好好跟她说", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "memory_018ele_002_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_018ele_002_2000_p", "source_sha256": "be151e04eed0d6a594c17c210335b8d0212f9b6e3ef9f12be9beb931d714c453", "ja": "エレナ。楽しい気持ちになれたかもしれないけど、\nアイドルとしては、それじゃダメだ。", "zh": "艾琳娜，虽然你觉得很开心，\n但作为偶像，那样是不行的。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "memory_018ele_002_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_018ele_002_2001_018ele", "source_sha256": "db073e95a9f76e3ac0186123d02bfe1f63f5c6b984914eac370b1edcb1e31b40", "ja": "えっ……？\nどうしてダメなノ？", "zh": "咦……？\n为什么不行？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "memory_018ele_002_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_018ele_002_2002_p", "source_sha256": "849b7e15472a3853cf38066a5487c641cb801ff7e9bf0548ab188b72ce19ca4d", "ja": "みんなを楽しませることで、自分も楽しくなる。\nそれがアイドルなんだよ。", "zh": "要借由让大家开心，使自己也跟着开心起来，\n这才是偶像。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "memory_018ele_002_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_018ele_002_2003_p", "source_sha256": "26ef47eda9ed21a172cd347d82a0caaee5a1d3533019698c3b3a475f11e493be", "ja": "自分ひとりで楽しい気持ちになっても、\nダメなんだ。", "zh": "只有自己一个人开心，\n那样是不行的。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "memory_018ele_002_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_018ele_002_2004_018ele", "source_sha256": "c8a1e029382e99c10c3680f75be49838d2d47267cf6253769aa6478f2f1b858d", "ja": "あ……。", "zh": "啊……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "memory_018ele_002_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_018ele_002_2005_p", "source_sha256": "ca136a50df9e4055f9e282b8c3136957b1dd985ee322871664b12156786f0fe9", "ja": "エレナは、自分だけが楽しければいいって思うか？", "zh": "艾琳娜，你觉得只要自己开心就够了吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "memory_018ele_002_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_018ele_002_2006_018ele", "source_sha256": "cf4b99c6d790f821ee549f52618c91de69962a7ebca9b9be087623d1753d007f", "ja": "お、思わないヨ！　みんなが楽しくないと、\nワタシも楽しい気持ちになれないもん……。", "zh": "我、我不觉得！要是大家不开心，\n我也开心不起来啊……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "memory_018ele_002_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_018ele_002_2007_p", "source_sha256": "f5d66837bf679e648145d49a2c98116bb93c2c66710c0c066c066ae246d2186a", "ja": "でも、今日はみんながエレナを待っていたんだ。\nエレナが来ないと何も始まらないから、ずっとな。", "zh": "但今天大家都在等艾琳娜。因为要是艾琳娜没来，\n就什么都开始不了，所以一直在等你。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "memory_018ele_002_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_018ele_002_2008_018ele", "source_sha256": "e8508bfcaca64fdabf486fafd45ad7f9cf1e2dcf6c35c37f400ade55609b9dae", "ja": "ずっと待ってるだけ……。\nそんなの、楽しくないよネ……。", "zh": "只是一直干等……\n那样不开心对吧……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "memory_018ele_002_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_018ele_002_2009_018ele", "source_sha256": "1477d1d1172b35962f7e6a1478996baf7c2cadb4888dd4f5b67b9495dc946564", "ja": "{$P$}。\nワタシ……、みんなに謝ってくる！", "zh": "{$P$}，\n我要……去向大家道歉！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "memory_018ele_002_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_018ele_002_2010_018ele", "source_sha256": "d89392e0780aa4443cecdb6495ef1466175b22baa93becb02e36ab33fadc81d3", "ja": "遅刻してゴメンナサイって、みんなに言うヨ～！", "zh": "我要去跟大家说抱歉迟到了～！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "memory_018ele_002_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_018ele_002_2011_p", "source_sha256": "06f7518b9ec5ed33f0c62e172e6c90cbc1851c24b7a6a5b0f15a14575e18efe5", "ja": "（その後、エレナがひとりひとりに謝ったおかげで、\nスタジオの空気は和やかに……）", "zh": "（之后，多亏艾琳娜一一去向大家道歉，\n摄影棚的气氛才缓和下来……）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "memory_018ele_002_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_018ele_002_2012_p", "source_sha256": "8a6e7a67b11b872a3188ec38305623b2295fc9588271e6587d149f990a93fd80", "ja": "（むしろ全員とのコミュニケーションが深まったせいか\nくつろいだ雰囲気で撮影は進んだ）", "zh": "（大概是因为她和所有人交流过，\n反而让拍摄能在轻松的气氛下进行。）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "memory_018ele_002_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_018ele_002_2013_018ele", "source_sha256": "44916df545b3f0a235ccc10bc695a6229cd67be59be5e79bd8735be54e37cee3", "ja": "エヘヘ、{$P$}！\n撮影、とっても楽しかったヨー♪", "zh": "嘿嘿，{$P$}！\n拍照很开心喔──♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "memory_018ele_002_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_018ele_002_2014_018ele", "source_sha256": "53f898f9c6a943ca3f6d247aa40aa1f2c3235591057732fb3a3428b48ede41b2", "ja": "でも、今日はゴメンナサイ。それと……ありがとネ！", "zh": "不过，今天真是抱歉。还有……谢谢你！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "memory_018ele_002_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_018ele_002_2015_018ele", "source_sha256": "96e79909dadaf777e3b28e45e5e436a6653a796000311c519b595cf9e4b3cb3f", "ja": "ひとりで笑顔になるんじゃなくて、みんなで笑顔に。\n今日はとっても大事なコト、教えてもらったヨ！", "zh": "不能一个人笑，要跟大家一起笑着。\n今天你教了我非常重要的事！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "memory_018ele_002_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_018ele_002_2016_p", "source_sha256": "bcb4bb835c8d7602458334b463edd24d752c347d89c3914c77a154b5938f3494", "ja": "エレナがすぐに謝ってくれたからだよ。\nおかげでいい宣材写真が撮れたぞ！", "zh": "多亏艾琳娜有马上去道歉，\n因此才拍出了很棒的宣传照喔！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "memory_018ele_002_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_018ele_002_2017_018ele", "source_sha256": "5c2c7f5c6f4899834bc94df99f239d1096ecc23a1aa9e0c3d0664b3a79aa3326", "ja": "ホント？　エヘヘ……。\n{$P$}にホメられちゃった。", "zh": "真的吗？嘿嘿……\n我被{$P$}称赞了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "memory_018ele_002_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_018ele_002_2018_018ele", "source_sha256": "999713b8eaddbfb23d5330808e5a7e7125bc03e3f6260da9550e36db55d6ffa4", "ja": "これからも、アイドルのお仕事、\nいっぱいできるといいナ……♪", "zh": "希望今后，\n也能从事很多偶像的工作……♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "memory_018ele_002_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_018ele_002_2019_p", "source_sha256": "7f51b83bdcfdc534698b20e755712132118f9758b213975068faed877605a30b", "ja": "（素直で無邪気だからこそ、失敗することもある。\nいい方に活かしていかないとな！）", "zh": "（正因为她坦率又天真无邪，所以有时也会失败。\n我要让她把这点发挥在好的方面上！）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
